WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:07.780
You have a product. To sell it online, you need a brand, a store, photos, videos… and a lot of time.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:13.010
With E-COM STUDIO IA, a single photo is all it takes to get started.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:21.720
The studio cuts out your product with pixel precision, measures its true colors, then suggests a name, a logo and brand guidelines.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:31.440
The AI then builds your Shopify theme from A to Z: the layout, the copy, and your product in real-life, everyday scenes.

00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:38.660
Something to change? Point to it in the preview and just say it: only that element is updated.

00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:45.489
Photos, ads and videos are ready in every format, always featuring your real product.

00:00:46.889 --> 00:00:51.119
The calendar prepares your posts. Nothing goes out without your approval.

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:56.819
E-COM STUDIO IA. One photo, one brand, a store that sells. Give it a try.
